  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Optimizacin de Gestin de la Calidad del Agua en Poblac Mayores a Cinco mil hab</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Optimization Of Water Quality Management In Comm with More Than 5,000 Inhabit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es contribuir a mejorar la calidad de los servicios de suministro de Agua Potable (AP) en localidades entre los 5.000 y 500.000 habitantes que sern beneficiarias del programa, a travs de: i) la rehabilitacin yo ampliacin de la infraestructura operativa de las Plantas Potabilizadoras de Agua (PPA) y laboratorios de agua; y ii) fortalecer la gestin del servicio de agua potable en la operacin, mantenimiento y control de su calidad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s objective is to help improve the quality of water and sanitation services in communities with between 5,000 and 500,000 inhabitants who will benefit from the program through: (i) the rehabilitation andor expansion of the operational infrastructure of water purification plants (WPPs) and water laboratories; and (ii) improved management of water services in terms of their operation, maintenance, and quality control.</narrative>
  </description>
